    <section class="d-none card"><div class="card-body">
The results of the Novice Jack&Jill prelim during Asia WCS Open  2026 in  Singapore at 04/16/2026.<br />
<br />
Judges in this round were Barry Goh, Charles Brown, Jula Palenga, Tze Ming Wee, Joelle Navarre, Anna Suzuki, Richard Chung, Jacques-Olivier Hache, Emma Collyer, Charles Brown, Sharon Her and Evgenia Itkina.    </div></section>

